---
source: crates/rustman-cli/src/tests.rs
expression: help
---
Open a run, exploration or bench report in the graphical viz companion (rustman-viz)

Usage: rustman viz [OPTIONS] <REPORT>

Arguments:
  <REPORT>
          A JSON report from `rustman run --reporter json`, `rustman explore run` or `rustman bench --report json=<file>`

Options:
      --view <VIEW>
          The view to open: dashboard (default), or graph for the API graph of an exploration
          
          [possible values: dashboard, graph]

      --color <WHEN>
          Color: auto (a terminal without NO_COLOR or TERM=dumb), always or never
          
          [default: auto]

  -v, --verbose...
          Log more on stderr: -v requests, -vv headers, -vvv everything (RUST_LOG, when set, replaces these levels)

  -h, --help
          Print help
